&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;About Flipp&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Flipp partners with the largest North American retailers and brands to deliver local promotions and savings to millions of engaged shoppers daily, driving superior returns on investments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We help people make smarter shopping decisions with autonomy and accountability. With rising living costs, Flipp&#39;s mission is crucial. Our Shopper Consideration Platform allows retailers and manufacturers to create digital experiences from their savings &amp;amp; deals content, aiding shoppers in deciding what to buy and where to buy it. Together, we make a difference.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In 2024, Flipp joined forces with the European company &lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://shopfully.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Shopfully&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, creating a global leader in the sector. Together, we reach 400 million households and serve over 1,000 top retailers and brands across 27 markets, including Europe, Canada, the USA, Latin America, and Australia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our five principles, Progress Over Perfection, Clarity Through Transparency, Learn Loudly, Challenge with Empathy, and Always Build Better, bring a relentless progress mindset to life. They’re not just slogans, but they’re the behaviours we expect, reward, and hold ourselves accountable to. You&#39;ll be equipped to make an impact, realize your potential, and stay inspired every step of the way.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Flipp&#39;s &lt;strong&gt;CPG and Retail Media&lt;/strong&gt; team focuses on building and maintaining relationships with existing CPG and Retail Media clients by understanding their business objectives and driving results against these to grow the partnership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Account Executive on the CPG and Retail Media team at Flipp, you will own a portfolio of some of the largest CPG advertisers in Canada and be responsible for turning those relationships into long-term, high-value partnerships. This role sits at the intersection of digital advertising, retail media, and CPG strategy — and the person who fills it will have direct line of sight into how Canadian brands invest and grow in the digital and retail media advertising space.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to driving strategic alignment with Flipp’s Brand partners, you will work with a best-in-class team to deliver against your revenue targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll get the opportunity to do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a growing book of 4-8 CPG accounts with strong relationships and significant growth opportunities across teams (Brand, Shopper, Sales and Agency).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the sales cycle end-to-end, including planning, sell-in, execution, reporting, and renewals into Flipp’s media offering. Leverage Flipp’s consultative sales motion — grounded in data, tailored storytelling, and compelling case studies — that demonstrates the platform’s value in terms that CPG partners actually care about.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish new and deepen existing relationships within your client portfolio, where you&#39;re seen not just as a vendor, but as a strategic advisor on how to win in the Canadian digital ad space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop strategic account plans across your entire book, shifting partnerships from tactical, ad hoc planning cycles to annual planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage Flipp’s evolving 1P data capabilities, in partnership with the Marketing Science team, to develop custom insights for CPG and agency partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring to the team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-7 years of sales experience. Those with experience in CPG, Digital Media, or Retail Media will find the position a strong fit (e.g., CPG sales, Media sales, Retail Media, Ad Tech, Media Agency).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record managing client relationships and partnering to drive measurable, attributable growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort analyzing and speaking to CPG and advertising insights, KPIs, and business performance metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently, manage multiple priorities, and take initiative in a fast-paced, ambiguous environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication skills that allow you to lead and influence thinking internally and externally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;column&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Support You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Total Rewards philosophy is to ensure that you are rewarded for impact, take part in accelerated career growth, thrive with highly flexible benefits, and are empowered to do your best work in a remote-first environment. In alignment with our overall Total Rewards Philosophy, we believe compensation should be fair, clear, consistent, and aligned to growth.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Canada Base Hiring Range:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$85,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$100,000 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Variable Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is eligible for a bonus based on Flipp&#39;s sales incentive plan, which is dependent on variables including the achievement of corporate goals, objective attainment, and personal performance. Additional details will be shared with candidates as they progress through the interview process&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Estimated variable bonus based on on-target attainment:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$25,500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$30,000 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Our promise to each other:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;table style=&quot;width: 83.5859%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;width: 53.174%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;width: 46.8272%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;width: 53.174%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An inclusive, collaborative environment where your voice matters&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A remote-first environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The tools and opportunities you need to grow and develop&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Every opportunity to own your success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;width: 46.8272%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your authentic self, every day&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your best work, from anywhere&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An appetite for learning, curiosity, and a growth mindset&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivation, initiative and the mind of an entrepreneur&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Here&#39;s how to apply:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is currently vacant and open for applications. If you’re interested in working with us on the future of shopping, fill out the fields below and submit your application. While experience and skill sets are valuable, growth potential and attitudes are equally important. If you’re prepared to grow dramatically with your team at a world-class learning organization, consider applying. We understand that the most creative solutions require diversity in thought and life experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Flipp is an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, color, ancestry, religion, creed, sex, national or ethnic origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, family status, disability, or gender identity or expression or any other protected grounds. We are proud to be a welcoming space for employees, of every background, to bring their whole selves to work with confidence. Flipp is committed to providing appropriate accommodations to ensure our selection process is equitable, and such accommodations can be made available on request. If you require an accommodation, please contact your dedicated recruiter directly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hiring is a deeply human process; therefore, we use AI in limited, administrative ways to help streamline our hiring process. An AI-powered scheduling tool assists with coordinating interviews, and our applicant tracking system may use AI to identify relevant keywords within applications. We do not use AI to assess your application, make hiring decisions, or conduct interviews. All evaluations are completed by real people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A member of our recruitment team will respond to you in the coming weeks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
